---
output: svg
---
@startuml
clock   "Clock_0"   as C0 with period 50
clock   "Clock_1"   as C1 with period 50 pulse 15 offset 10
binary  "Binary"  as B
concise "Concise" as C
rectangle "Rectangle" as Re
robust  "Robust"  as R
analog  "Analog"  as A


@0
C is Idle
R is Idle
Re is Idle
A is 0

@100
B is high
C is Waiting
Re is Waiting
R is Processing
A is 3

@300
R is Waiting
A is 1
@enduml
